    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A rare opportunity  to purchase a unique, recently renovated, two dwelling property with panoramic views of the Gweebara estuary and Atlantic.\r\n\r\nBrendan Kearns, Hills Property, is pleased to present this picturesque two-residence estate consisting of two detached turn key bungalows (F94 DD77 and F94 C934) in Farrigans, Lettermacaward, Co Donegal.\r\n\r\nWith unspoilt views of Corr Point, leading on to the stunning Dooey beach, this 'edge of the Atlantic' location sets the bar high for coastal properties.\r\n(Images of Dooey beach taken in May 2026 included with property images)\r\n\r\nIn addition to sea views, this idyllic location offers stunning sun sets and an abundance of country walking routes.  For cycling / walking / running enthusiasts, the Glenties - Dungloe cycle track is just 2.8km from the property and provides a high quality tarmac 25km route adjacent to the main N56.\r\n\r\nWhile the properties are individual and detached, with their own eircode's, their proximity to each other makes the purchase of this two-residence estate convenient and suitable for a range of different living arrangements including;\r\n\r\n:: One or two personal residences\r\n:: One personal residence / one holiday rental \r\n:: Two holiday rentals\r\n\r\nThe estate has been used for a combination of the above in the past. \r\n\r\nAs holiday rentals, the properties maintained an overall 5 Star rating with consistent occupancy throughout the year.\r\n\r\nAs personal residences, the properties are located close to bus routes, shops / forecourt, bars, restaurant, doctors surgery, garage, churches and schools.\r\n\r\nExcellent broadband connectivity in the area has facilitated ease of access for remote working & staying connected while on holiday, for adults and children."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The Front Property (F94 DD77) contains:\r\n\r\nEntrance Porch: 1.75m x 0,75m\r\nHallway: 7.4m2. Solid wooden floor, 1/2 glazed composite door to front, radiator\r\nKitchen: 4.8m x 2m. Tiled floor, upper & lower built in units, solid wood work top, 1/2 glazed composite door to back, window to side & back, access to loft room\r\nLoft room: 3.75m x 2m\r\nLiving Room / Dining Room:  5m x 3.6m. Solid wooden floor, two front windows, flush LED ceiling lights, built in coffee dock, radiator\r\nBedroom / Sitting Room: 4.45m x 3.6m. Solid wooden floor, two front windows, flush LED ceiling lights, built in floor to ceiling units, radiator, open fireplace\r\nBedroom: 5m x 3.6m.  Solid wooden floor, two back windows, flush LED ceiling lights, built in wardrobe, radiator, bath, plumbed for en suite (WC, hand basin, shower).  En Suite was previously in place.\r\nBedroom: 3.6 x 3.5m.  Solid wooden floor, back window, flush LED ceiling lights, radiator\r\nBathroom: 2.7m x 2.5m.  Tiled floor, back window, flush LED ceiling lights, radiator, built in floor to ceiling units, WC, hand basin, bath with shower, extractor fan, mirror & vanity unit\r\n(BER: F)\r\n(Floor Area: 85.45m2)\r\n\r\nThe Back Property (F94 C934) contains:\r\n\r\nEntrance Porch: 1.6m x 1m.  Tiled floor, half glaze composite door to front, side window\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 4.6m x 3.5m. Tiled floor, upper & lower built in units, solid wood work top, tiled splash back, windows to front and back, ceiling spotlights, radiator, 1/2 glazed composite door to back\r\nBedroom / Sitting Room: 3.8m x 3.5m.  Windows to front and back, laminate floor, radiator\r\nBedroom: 3.9m x 2.1m.  Window to back, laminate floor, radiator\r\nBathroom: 3.9m x 1.4m.  Window to front, tiled floor, radiator, enclosed tiled shower, hand basin, WC, radiator\r\nGarage / shed: 3.5m x 3.5m\r\n(BER: G)\r\n(Floor Area: 48.67m2)"
